# RAWMIN SKINOLOGY Next.js UI Standards

Brand: **RAWMIN SKINOLOGY** (`lib/constants.ts` → `SITE`). Theme: packaging seafoam `#ACC9C2` (page background), cream cards `#FAF8F5`, blue accent `#3A7BD5` (`lib/brand-colors.ts`, `app/globals.css`).

## SEO (every route)

- Use `buildMetadata()` from `lib/seo.ts` with title, description, keywords, canonical path, OG, and Twitter.
- Add JSON-LD via `components/seo/json-ld.tsx`.
- Maintain `app/sitemap.ts` and `app/robots.ts` when adding routes.

## Images & fonts

- Always `next/image` with `sizes` and meaningful `alt`.
- Use `next/font/google` (DM Sans + Playfair Display).

## Animation

- Scroll compare manufacturing stages in hero/story (`scroll-compare-stages.tsx`).
- Lenis smooth scroll via `AppProviders`.
- Honor `prefers-reduced-motion`.

## B2B positioning

- Third-party / private label manufacturer—not direct retail. No shop-first language on catalog pages.
